01.01 C MILEAGE PROGRAM
01.09 E
01.10 A "  STARTING MILES "SM
01.20 T !"ENTER MILES AND AMOUNT OF FUEL"!
01.30 A M;I (M)1.6;A MG;S G=G+MG;S CM=M;G 1.3
01.60 S DM=CM-SM;S MI=DM/G
01.70 T %6.01,!!"AVERAGE MILEAGE "MI," MI/GAL"!
01.80 A "ARE YOU PLANNING A TRIP? "Q;I (Q-0YES)1.9,2.1
01.90 Q

02.10 T !!"ENTER DISTANCE AND PRICE OF FUEL (CENTS/GAL)
02.20 A !D,C;S D=D/MI;S CS=D*C/100
02.30 T %5,!"YOU WILL USE "D,%6.02," GALLONS AT A COST OF $"CS,!!;Q
p